Bob Bellows: Hey Cap'n
You: Ahoy there Bob! How be ye?
Bob Bellows: Alright I guess
You: Good, good. Now Bob, I know you're a good listener. At least, you're not much of a talker. Have you heard of anything to do with a mutiny on board?
BB: Mutiny? I don't know nothing about no mutiny. Though I have seen Marley and Lisa talking quite a bit recently. Not sure what business Lisa could have with a liar like Marley, but maybe they know something.
=> END